comment "PortalPlayer PP502x Configuration Options"

config PP502X_PLL_BOOST
	bool "Run the core from the 80 MHz PLL"
	default y
	---help---
		Start the PLL and switch the core clock from the 24 MHz crystal
		to 80 MHz at boot.  If the PLL does not lock in time the core
		stays on the crystal.  When disabled the clock stays as the
		boot loader left it.
